  "body": "Elevated above the road on a generous 853sqm northeast-facing site, this property enjoys lovely valley view's towards Rangitoto and a sheltered position away from southerly winds.\r\n\r\nCurrently occupied by a 1930s two-bedroom weatherboard home in original condition, the property presents an opportunity for buyers with vision. Refurbish the existing home, consider relocation or investigate the possibilities for redevelopment.\r\n\r\nOffered to the market for the very first time, this substantial landholding provides an opportunity to secure a well-positioned property with scope to add value, subject to the necessary investigations and approvals.\r\n\r\nBuyers are encouraged to request an information pack and explore the possibilities for themselves.\r\n\r\nDeadline Sale 4pm Tuesday 8th December 2026.\r\n\r\nViewing Sat/Sun 1.15 - 2.00pm or private appointment",
